# Scraped reference material: DBD wiki pages and BHVR site screenshots
# pulled in while designing the chrome. Research scratch, not part of the app.
.firecrawl/

# Drafted announcement copy for the Discord server. Not part of the app.
.discord-posts/

# The unit tests. Kept out of the repo on purpose, not because they are
# scratch -- they are run before every commit and they are the reason several
# bugs in this file's history were caught. They simply are not part of what
# ships to anyone reading the game's source.
#
# tools/verify-cards.mjs and tools/verify-save-repaints.mjs deliberately stay
# tracked: those two gate GENERATED data, and a clone without them can ship a
# card whose description silently went missing.
# Anywhere, not just ui/ -- tools/lib/resolve.test.mjs was missed by a
# narrower pattern and shipped once because of it.
*.test.mjs

# Written to the repo root by the screenshot harness and deleted again on the
# same run. Only ever left behind if that run dies partway.
_shot.html
